# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Built-in Flutter l10n codegen (flutter: generate: true / l10n.yaml) —
# regenerated automatically on every `flutter pub get`/`flutter test`/
# `flutter build`, unlike tool/generate_models.dart's output which needs an
# explicit run + a CI drift gate. Source of truth is lib/l10n/*.arb.
/lib/l10n/app_localizations*.dart

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/
